00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:36.737
Things that I did right,
things that I did wrong.

00:02:36.737 --> 00:02:38.623
Things I want to remind myself of

00:02:38.623 --> 00:02:40.882
the next time I go
through this process again

00:02:40.882 --> 00:02:42.135
if I do it again.

