Hopefully the headaches
that I went through

00:02:52.951 --> 00:02:54.942
and the winds that I went through

00:02:54.942 --> 00:02:57.828
documenting on that series
are beneficial to you.

00:02:57.828 --> 00:02:58.661
That's why I made it.

00:02:58.661 --> 00:03:01.090
And it was a fun series to put together.

