00:03:20.078 --> 00:03:22.935
That I was allowed to make
basically in the timeframe

00:03:22.935 --> 00:03:23.768
that we had.

00:03:23.768 --> 00:03:25.018
So the arrow is

00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:27.999
different words.

00:03:28.869 --> 00:03:29.702
You can see it there.

00:03:29.702 --> 00:03:31.028
The arrow is different words.

