00:09:44.366 --> 00:09:45.364
Next up, Sharif,

00:09:45.364 --> 00:09:47.477
I've done decades of graphic
design or related work.

00:09:47.477 --> 00:09:49.776
I don't think you're looking
at your cover objectively Evan.

00:09:49.776 --> 00:09:52.527
You should be happy as it
is an excellent modern,

00:09:52.527 --> 00:09:54.373
yet simple, informative yet clear,

00:09:54.373 --> 00:09:56.765
original yet professional,
different yet minimalist.

00:09:56.765 --> 00:09:59.424
It's easily an above-average book cover.

00:09:59.424 --> 00:10:01.624
Any simpler and it would
look less greeting,

00:10:01.624 --> 00:10:05.026
any more designed and it
would have looked too busy.

00:10:05.026 --> 00:10:06.378
Listen, a lot of people
like the book cover.

00:10:06.378 --> 00:10:07.690
My agent loves the book cover,

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.490
my publisher loves the book cover,

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.651
I'm sure the people in the art department

00:10:10.651 --> 00:10:12.003
love the book cover.

00:10:12.003 --> 00:10:13.274
I come at it from two perspectives.

00:10:13.274 --> 00:10:14.552
One,

00:10:14.552 --> 00:10:18.076
when you say it's easily an
above average book cover,

00:10:18.076 --> 00:10:19.550
that doesn't get me excited.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.801
I don't want to be an
above average anything.

00:10:22.801 --> 00:10:26.046
Like the things that I'm spending
a year of my time creating

00:10:26.046 --> 00:10:27.718
I don't want it to just be above average.

00:10:27.718 --> 00:10:28.551
Like that

00:10:28.551 --> 00:10:30.046
that upsets me

00:10:30.046 --> 00:10:31.003
deeply.

00:10:31.003 --> 00:10:33.233
That the work that I'm
spending so much time on

00:10:33.233 --> 00:10:35.479
because the content in the book is not

00:10:35.479 --> 00:10:36.878
just above average.

00:10:36.878 --> 00:10:39.444
It's way better than above average.

00:10:39.444 --> 00:10:41.749
And so, I'm upset that
the cover that reflects it

00:10:41.749 --> 00:10:43.833
is just above average.

00:10:43.833 --> 00:10:45.666
And the second part is

00:10:47.182 --> 00:10:49.092
a lot of this is what
comes from the heart.

00:10:49.092 --> 00:10:51.930
When you look at something,
art is subjective.

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:56.133
So, I look at that, and
I'm just not moved by it.

00:10:56.133 --> 00:10:58.130
I want to be moved by it.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.628
You may be moved by it, you may like it.

00:10:59.628 --> 00:11:00.461
Lot of people like it,

00:11:00.461 --> 00:11:01.782
but,

00:11:01.782 --> 00:11:04.342
ideally, I want to look
at something and say,

00:11:04.342 --> 00:11:05.175
"Man!

00:11:05.175 --> 00:11:06.008
"Look at that cover!"

00:11:06.008 --> 00:11:08.144
And every time I look at it, I remember

00:11:08.144 --> 00:11:09.711
Believe or I remember the impact

00:11:09.711 --> 00:11:10.715
or I'm just,

00:11:10.715 --> 00:11:11.755
I'm wowed by it

00:11:11.755 --> 00:11:12.631
and this just doesn't do it.

00:11:12.631 --> 00:11:14.994
Like these pictures behind
me are here for a reason.

00:11:14.994 --> 00:11:17.320
The selection, the angle of faces,

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.044
the everything, the size

00:11:19.044 --> 00:11:20.571
it's all designed

00:11:20.571 --> 00:11:21.404
and picked

00:11:21.404 --> 00:11:22.237
with

00:11:22.237 --> 00:11:23.538
with importance!

00:11:23.538 --> 00:11:24.426
With relevance.

00:11:24.426 --> 00:11:26.127
There's a reason why they're all here.

00:11:26.127 --> 00:11:27.329
There's a reason why there's five.

00:11:27.329 --> 00:11:28.943
And there's a reason why
they're looking certain ways.

00:11:28.943 --> 00:11:30.568
There's a reason for all of it

00:11:30.568 --> 00:11:31.401
and I got to do that,

00:11:31.401 --> 00:11:32.234
and I'm happy.

00:11:32.234 --> 00:11:34.901
I love walking in here everyday.

00:11:38.037 --> 00:11:38.870
Like

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:39.703
you know

00:11:39.703 --> 00:11:40.655
I just don't love it, that's all.

00:11:40.655 --> 00:11:43.209
I love that you guys love it.

00:11:43.209 --> 00:11:44.811
I just don't love it.

00:11:44.811 --> 00:11:45.659
It's okay.

00:11:45.659 --> 00:11:46.547
I'm not complaining.

00:11:46.547 --> 00:11:48.184
Next time, it's a good lesson for me

00:11:48.184 --> 00:11:49.223
that I got to do better.

00:11:49.223 --> 00:11:50.546
I got to plan it out more.

00:11:50.546 --> 00:11:52.109
I got to spend just as
much time on the outside

00:11:52.109 --> 00:11:53.880
as I did on the inside.

